  "id": "roasted-pork-tenderloin",
  "name": "Roasted Pork Tenderloin",
  "subtitle": "Tender pork with sweet-tart sauerkraut",
  "description": "Seasoned pork tenderloin roasts over sauerkraut with apple, onion, and brown sugar for a savory-sweet main dish.",
